{
  "$comment": "BeWise Wellness design tokens — single source of truth. Owner: HUB. Brand guide §3, §4, §10. Changing primary navy, logo or core fonts requires owner approval (brand guide §12). v2 Quiet Luxury approved 2026-11-16 (D-21, D-22).",
